  "tvLegalSection1Title": "1. Dabeecadda abka — CIYAARIYE oo keliya",
  "tvLegalSection1Body": "Abkani waa CIYAARIYE warbaahin oo daariya qulqullada codka/muuqaalka uu isticmaaluhu keeno. MA BIXIYO, MA IIBIYO, MA MARTIGELIYO, MA BAAHIYO, MANA URURIYO TUSMO kanaallo telefishan, qulqullo, barnaamijyo maqal iyo muuqaal ah, liisas (M3U) ama aqoonsiyada adeegga (Xtream). Wax barnaamij ah kuma jiraan, horay looguma soo rarin, lamana iibiyo abka.",
  "tvLegalSection2Title": "2. Barnaamijyada uu isticmaaluhu keeno",
  "tvLegalSection2Body": "Isticmaaluhu wuxuu keenaa ilihiisa gaarka ah (xiriiriyeyaasha M3U / aqoonsiyada Xtream), oo uu ka helo bixiyihiisa. Isticmaalaha OO KELIYA ayaa mas'uul ka ah waxyaabaha uu ku daro, daawado ama baahiyo, iyo inuu haysto xuquuqda, rukhsadaha iyo rukumashooyinka loo baahan yahay.",
  "tvLegalSection3Title": "3. Rukumashadu = SOFTWARE, ma aha barnaamijyada",
  "tvLegalSection3Body": "Lacag-bixin ama rukumasho kasta waxay KELIYA daboolaysaa isticmaalka abka (ciyaariyaha iyo sifooyinkiisa: muuqaalka, kuwa la jecel yahay, duubista qalabka, EPG…). Marna MA AHA iibsasho, iibin, kireyn ama bixinta kanaallo, qulqullo ama barnaamijyo.",
  "tvLegalSection4Title": "4. Isticmaal sharci ah",
  "tvLegalSection4Body": "Isticmaaluhu wuxuu oggolaanayaa inuu abka u isticmaalo si waafaqsan shuruucda dalkiisa, oo uusan ku gelin wax sharci-darro ah ama ku xadgudbaya xuquuqda daabacaadda. Isticmaal sharci-darro ah si adag ayaa loo mamnuucay, mas'uuliyaddiisana waxaa leh isticmaalaha oo keliya.",
  "tvLegalSection5Title": "5. Waxyaabaha dhinacyada saddexaad — mas'uuliyad ma leh",
  "tvLegalSection5Body": "Daabacuhu ma xakameeyo waxyaabaha dhinacyada saddexaad ee lagu helo ilaha isticmaaluhu keeno, mas'uulna lagama dhigi karo. Ma dammaanad qaado helitaanka, sharciyadda ama tayada waxyaabahaas.",
  "tvLegalSection6Title": "6. Hantida aqooneed iyo cabashooyinka",
  "tvLegalSection6Body": "Dhammaan summadaha ganacsi, astaamaha iyo barnaamijyada waxaa leh milkiilayaashooda. Maadaama abku uusan martigelin wax barnaamij ah, cabashooyinka xuquuqda daabacaadda waa in loo diraa bixiyaha isha ay khusayso.",
  "tvLegalSection7Title": "7. Waxaa loo bixiyaa “sida uu yahay”",
  "tvLegalSection7Body": "Abka waxaa loo bixiyaa “sida uu yahay”, iyadoo aan la dammaanad qaadin inuu mar kasta diyaar yahay ama khaladaad ka maran yahay. Daabacuhu wuu beddeli karaa ama hakin karaa qaar ama dhammaan sifooyinka.",
  "tvLegalSection8Title": "8. Xogta shakhsiga",
  "tvLegalSection8Body": "Aqoonsi farsamo oo qalabku leeyahay ayaa loo isticmaalaa maamulka rukhsadda/tijaabada iyo taageerada. Faahfaahin: app.7themotion.com/privacy.",
  "tvLegalSection9Title": "9. Oggolaanshaha",
  "tvLegalSection9Body": "Marka la rakibo ama la isticmaalo abkan, isticmaaluhu wuxuu qirayaa inuu akhriyey oo aqbalay shuruudahan. Nooca buuxa ee internetka: app.7themotion.com/terms",
  "tvLegalLead": "Abkani waa ciyaariye. Ma iibiyo mana bixiyo kanaallo ama xiriiriyeyaal. Kor/hoos si aad u rogto, Dib si aad uga baxdo.",
